From 0ce4b132a053a2f2df617b265488887e6dfe532a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 14:48:04 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/53] Two-stage AI command search and OpenRouter key row for
 embedded builds

Embedded (remote_tty) builds register the Warp AI async source twice: a fast
stage at the AI Command Search delay (now 50 ms by default, like desktop) and
an expanded stage that waits for at least a 400 ms pause. The host page's
warpPanelGenerateCommands gets the stage, so the host can answer quickly with
one model and add non-duplicate options from a slower one. The AI provider key
row now takes an OpenRouter key.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
